# Code-signing key material. These must never enter the repo: the leaf key and
# the .p12 that wraps it can sign releases as this publisher, and the root key
# can mint new signing certs that every customer machine already trusts.
# Keep them outside the working tree (see scripts/sign-windows.sh); these
# patterns are a backstop against an accidental copy.
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.csr
*.srl
